<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Equity Residential view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Equity Residential view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said on Wednesday it raised its FFO estimates on Equity Residential Properties Trust to $3.13 from $3.10 for 1996 and to $3.55 from $3.53 for 1997 after the company reported above-consensus Q3 results.</p>
<p>--EVEREN also said it raised its 18-month price target on the stock to $42 from $40.</p>
<p>--Equity Residential was trading at 39, up 1-1/2.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
